{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thru Hike is a challenging climbing game, a homage to Bennet Foddy's 2017  classic 'Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy.' Become familiar with this hinky pole. Learn to run vault perch spring cling scramble wedge fail fall and try again. Follow the path of least resistance, or attempt to ascend to great heights and plumb the deeps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the\u00a0papier coll\u00e9 journey across the American National Parks. Visit the vibrant sandstone desert of Utah, the lush valley and granite sentinels of Yosemite, and the\u00a0majestic glaciated volcano of Mount Rainer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- 1 dollar from every sale will be donated to the National Parks Conservation Association --</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733010?t=1753298362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733010?t=1753298362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733010/2bb0dffb0854d34c6a96da7c93c4780398924c6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753298362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733010/2bb0dffb0854d34c6a96da7c93c4780398924c6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753298362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thru Hike is a challenging climbing game, a homage to Bennet Foddy's 2017  classic 'Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy.' Become familiar with this hinky pole. Learn to run vault perch spring cling scramble wedge fail fall and try again. Follow the path of least resistance, or attempt to ascend to great heights and plumb the deeps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the\u00a0papier coll\u00e9 journey across the American National Parks. Visit the vibrant sandstone desert of Utah, the